{"4481110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chud vs Soyjak", "steam_appid": 4481110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chud vs Soyjak</strong> is a game where you play as Chud, in a world that just doesn't understand him. You will endure injustices at the hands of Chad, Stacy, and Soyjak. In this survival shooter you will make them pay with action packed gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this generational masterpiece:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL</strong> get at least 30 minutes of peak gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL</strong> experience a thrilling story featuring full voice acting from /v/'s finest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL</strong> enjoy an original soundtrack featuring Baby Sneed™</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL </strong>become immersed in 7+ hand crafted levels featuring custom weather effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL</strong> feel the raw power behind<strong> FOUR</strong> different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to survive against:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWENTY+</strong> different enemy types each with unique AI behavior, attack patterns, and art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS </strong>waves of every increasing difficulty, can you get the high score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet our diverse and enthralling cast of characters including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Janny</strong> - Will you let him prune your thread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bossjak</strong> - Are you ready to lose your wagie job?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Stacy</strong> - Will she go on a date with you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Chad</strong> - Will he let you go on a date with her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yakub</strong> - Can you save Agartha?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CHUD - IT'S SO OVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to fight against <strong>SOYCIETY </strong>in this 2.5D boomer shooter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chud vs Soyjak</strong> is a game where you play as Chud, in a world that just doesn't understand him. You will endure injustices at the hands of Chad, Stacy, and Soyjak. In this survival shooter you will make them pay with action packed gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this generational masterpiece:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL</strong> get at least 30 minutes of peak gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL</strong> experience a thrilling story featuring full voice acting from /v/'s finest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL</strong> enjoy an original soundtrack featuring Baby Sneed™</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL </strong>become immersed in 7+ hand crafted levels featuring custom weather effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU WILL</strong> feel the raw power behind<strong> FOUR</strong> different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to survive against:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWENTY+</strong> different enemy types each with unique AI behavior, attack patterns, and art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS </strong>waves of every increasing difficulty, can you get the high score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet our diverse and enthralling cast of characters including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Janny</strong> - Will you let him prune your thread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bossjak</strong> - Are you ready to lose your wagie job?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>